##
## directory: container data volume, one per stack that has state
##
## Each service keeps its own, next to its configuration, i.e.
## backend/containers/redis/data, so these patterns are matched at any depth on
## purpose. They are the safety net, the rule itself lives in each stack's own
## ignore file.
